# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PRIVACY GUARD — see PRIVACY.md
# This repo holds the PLAN, never the DATA. Populated financial, medical, and
# credential data must live OUTSIDE this repo (encrypted store / password
# manager / with the solicitor). The patterns below are a safety net so that
# sensitive files can't be committed by accident. Do NOT force-add past them
# without a deliberate reason.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Designated local-only area — never tracked. Put anything sensitive here if
# it must sit on disk, and keep it out of git entirely.
/private/
/local/
*.local
*.local.*

# Spreadsheets & data exports (asset registers, bank statements, valuations)
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.tsv
*.ods
*.numbers

# Augment sidecar caches (tools/augment.py) — belong beside the real
# workbook or under private/, never tracked
*.augment.json

# Credential / key material
*.kdbx
*.kdb
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets*
password*
passwords*
credential*

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Python build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
